{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50775","headline":"题天竺寺 · 张祜","name":"题天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台殿耸高摽，钟声下小子遥。\n路分松到寺，山断石爲桥。\n引水穿廊去，呼猿绕槛眺。\n海明初上月，法白正来潮。\n夏雨莲苞破，秋风桂子雕。\n（「夏雨」二句，《嘉泰会稽志》卷九引。\n《全唐诗》卷五一一据《海录碎事》收入。\n）乱云行没脚，欹树过低腰。\n嫩绿茶新焙，乾黄竹旋烧。\n唯思闲事了，长此卧烟霄。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}